          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>If you’ve driven down Route 9, there’s a good chance you’ve seen us—the building with the artwork right by the Mizzen Avenue light. We’ve been part of this community for decades, and we’ve made it easy for families in Pine Beach and nearby towns to stop in, get the care they need, and feel comfortable doing it.</p><p>You’ll find our office at 90 Atlantic City Boulevard. It’s a standalone building with its own parking lot, so you won’t have to search for a spot or deal with crowded plazas. We’re also easily accessible, with a ramp for patients who need it.</p>",
          "align": "center",
          "id": "dQ9T8fSkyr",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
