        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Eye Care for the Whole Family",
          "html": "Eye Care for the Whole Family&nbsp;",
          "id": "3kQaP0FVtm",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>When you visit our office, you’ll find more than just a routine eye exam. We provide care for the whole family, from <a href=\"/eye-care-services/comprehensive-eye-exams/\">comprehensive eye exams</a> to medical eye care, dry eye treatment, and more. With our in-house lab, patients can even get their glasses the same day.</p><h3>Emergency Eye Care</h3><p>Eye issues don’t always happen at a convenient time, and when something feels wrong, it’s important to get it checked sooner rather than later. Whether you’re dealing with sudden vision changes, an eye injury, redness, or discomfort that won’t go away, we offer emergency eye care in Pine Beach whenever possible.</p>",
          "id": "u8IoC5ig20",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        }
